# Skyline icon sources. One line per icon: Name kind sizes
#   kind   vector = Icons/Vector/Name.xaml rendered at each size
#          raster = Icons/Raster/Name.W.H.png (hq2x 2x of the native bitmap) copied at W and bicubic-scaled to the others
#   sizes  square pixel sizes to emit; the native 16 (or 14) px bitmap stays the hand-tuned original
# 16 px icons emit 20, 24, 32 (125%, 150%, 200%); 14 px icons emit 18, 21, 28.

